			"notes": "# Version 1.4.4 (Skipped version(s) were kept private).\n\n## Changes:\n- Reorganised config menu.\n- Removed node height option.\n- Added flint rng.\n- Made config save only if changes were made.\n- Made config save when done button is pressed. (Instead of saving every time an option is changed)\n- Added an eye break config option.\n- Made iron golems always drop 5 iron. (Requires \"Guarantee Entity Drops\" option)\n- Added a \"No Early Flyaway\" option. (For ender dragon)\n\nThanks to Boyenn for sponsoring this project ❤️ . (He paid all of the server stuff)\nIf you wanna support this project, there is a ko-fi link linked to this repo. It takes a lot of time to make mods like these.\n\n## Enjoy!!!"
		},
